{"name":"Typewriter Ink","hex":"#4c5053","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"typewriter","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A device, at least partially mechanical, used to print text by pressing keys that cause type to be impressed through an inked ribbon onto paper.","One who uses a typewriter; a typist."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/typewriter"},{"term":"ink","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A pigment (or dye)-based fluid used for writing, printing etc.","A particular type, color or container of this fluid."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To apply ink to; to cover or smear with ink.","To sign (a contract or similar document)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ink"}],"entries":[{"title":"Typewriter","blocks":[{"text":"A typewriter is a mechanical or electromechanical machine for typing characters. Typically, a typewriter has an array of keys, and each one causes a different single character to be produced on paper by striking an inked ribbon selectively against the paper with a type element. Thereby, the machine produces a legible written document composed of ink and paper. By the end of the 19th century, a person who used such a device was also referred to as a typist or a typewriter."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/MEK_II-371.jpg/330px-MEK_II-371.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Typewriter"},{"title":"Ink","blocks":[{"text":"Ink is a gel, sol, or solution that contains at least one colorant, such as a dye or pigment, and is used to color a surface to produce an image, text, or design. Ink is used for drawing or writing with a pen, brush, reed pen, or quill. Thicker inks, in paste form, are used extensively in letterpress and lithographic printing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/F%C3%BCller-tinte_hg.jpg/330px-F%C3%BCller-tinte_hg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ink"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/1864_Schreibmaschine_Peter_Mitterhofer.jpg/500px-1864_Schreibmaschine_Peter_Mitterhofer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/1864_Schreibmaschine_Peter_Mitterhofer.jpg/1280px-1864_Schreibmaschine_Peter_Mitterhofer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/1864_Schreibmaschine_Peter_Mitterhofer.jpg/500px-1864_Schreibmaschine_Peter_Mitterhofer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Peter Mitterhofer's typewriter prototype (1864)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A1864_Schreibmaschine_Peter_Mitterhofer.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Malling_Hansen%2C1867%2C_D%C3%A4nemark.jpg/500px-Malling_Hansen%2C1867%2C_D%C3%A4nemark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Malling_Hansen%2C1867%2C_D%C3%A4nemark.jpg/1280px-Malling_Hansen%2C1867%2C_D%C3%A4nemark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Malling_Hansen%2C1867%2C_D%C3%A4nemark.jpg/500px-Malling_Hansen%2C1867%2C_D%C3%A4nemark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Hansen Writing Ball was the first typewriter manufactured commercially (1870).","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMalling_Hansen%2C1867%2C_D%C3%A4nemark.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Sholes_typewriter.jpg/500px-Sholes_typewriter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=th